parameters.inputSchema:
{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "Single Category Scoring Report (Revised)",
  "description": "Schema for a single set of scoring data, including a total score, detailed breakdown, and overall textual feedback.",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "category": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "The main category name for the overall score."
    },
    "totalScore": {
      "type": "number",
      "description": "The aggregated final score for this category."
    },
    "detailedScoring": {
      "description": "An object containing scores for sub-categories.",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": {
        "type": "number",
        "description": "The score assigned to an individual sub-category."
      }
    },
    "feedback": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Overall textual feedback provided for this category."
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "category",
    "totalScore",
    "detailedScoring",
    "feedback"
  ]
}

{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "Comprehensive Scoring Report (Final)",
  "description": "Schema for a complete report containing a global score and an array of individual category scoring breakdowns, each including feedback.",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "globalScore": {
      "type": "number",
      "description": "The overall final score for the entire report."
    },
    "categoryScores": {
      "type": "array",
      "description": "A list of objects, each detailing the score and feedback for a specific category.",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [ "category", "totalScore", "detailedScoring", "feedback" ],
        "properties": {
          "category": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The name of this specific category."
          },
          "totalScore": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "The aggregated score for this specific category."
          },
          "detailedScoring": {
            "description": "An object containing scores for sub-categories within this category.",
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "number",
              "description": "The score assigned to an individual sub-category."
            }
          },
          "feedback": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Overall textual feedback provided for this category."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "globalScore",
    "categoryScores"
  ]
}

parameters.text:
=Based on the provided JSONs of several sub agents that are grading a coding submission, how high would you grade the global score, a.k.a. the score of the total assignment from 0 (bad) to 100 (good)?
Keep the score between 0 and 100.
For example: 0.8 will turn into 80, 1.0 will turn into 100, and 0.1 will turn into 10.

You will output a combined JSON with everything included, but your global score will be a value in this string.

Do not change any values, you only decide on the global Score.

You may reduce the feedback if you think it is too much. Dont cut anything relevant away though which might be important for personal code development, understanding of the assignments or similiar.

Rename the categories so it is typed correctly ("out-of-scope" becomes "Out of Scope")

{{JSON.stringify($json.output)}}

{{JSON.stringify($('Out-Of-Scope Detector').item.json.output) }}

{{ JSON.stringify($('Lint Agent').item.json.output) }}

{{ JSON.stringify($('Style Agent').item.json.output) }}
